{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.1468023254747578,"w":0.58024693806966143,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"x":0.17901233332724842,"t":"After the war, the park was turned back more or less to how it had been before"},{"t":"1914, and continued almost unchanged until recently. Plans for transforming it","x":0.17695472016233396,"y":0.16133720916912409,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.58024693806966143},{"y":0.17579505309253274,"w":0.59670781453450517,"t":"were drawn up at various times, most recently in 2013, though they were revised","x":0.17901234778116626,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"w":0.59670781453450517,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"in 2015, before any work had started. The changes finally got going in 2016, and","y":0.19040697662436912,"x":0.17695473460553132,"c":1},{"h":0.013173524005112514,"x":0.17890013001552016,"y":0.2036471604378457,"w":0.26566996256510411,"t":"were finished on schedule last year.","c":1},{"w":0.59681793212890621,"y":0.23975749470418473,"h":0.014495050949258403,"t":"OK, let me tell you about some of the changes that have been made - and some","c":1,"x":0.17895776019148041},{"x":0.17901234431717009,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703,"w":0.56378601074218759,"y":0.2558139533816941,"t":"things that have been retained. If you look at this map, you'll see the familiar"},{"h":0.014551419953434896,"t":"outline of the park, with the river forming the northern boundary, and a gate in","x":0.17896547141898916,"y":0.26885101051524174,"w":0.57211761474609379,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"each of the other three walls. The statue of Diane Gosforth has been moved: it","y":0.28474676072320959,"w":0.58230453491210932,"x":0.17901234149991693,"h":0.011778563015312105},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"used to be close to the south gate, but it's now immediately to the north of the lily.","x":0.17901233867333399,"y":0.29941860454456404,"c":1,"w":0.60082305908203126},{"c":1,"w":0.54115224202473966,"h":0.011778563015312216,"y":0.31389870422505051,"t":"pond, almost in the centre of the park, which makes it much more visible.","x":0.17901235625398063},{"c":1,"x":0.17691094494718035,"t":"There's a new area of wooden sculptures, which are on the river bank, where the","y":0.33424572070080028,"w":0.60295735677083329,"h":0.015385173936895535},{"y":0.34883720958289999,"w":0.3353909301757812,"h":0.013081394460653373,"x":0.17901235767445495,"t":"path from the east gate makes a sharp bend.","c":1},{"t":"There are two areas that are particularly intended for children. The playground","w":0.57818929036458333,"x":0.17901235069609631,"y":0.37063953476165645,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.59273071289062496,"c":1,"t":"has been enlarged and improved, and that's between the river and the path that","y":0.38449222425344765,"h":0.014668214166683957,"x":0.17894933641985328},{"y":0.40106007065267191,"h":0.011778563015312216,"c":1,"t":"leads from the pond to the river.","x":0.17695473835979267,"w":0.23868311564127606},{"y":0.42137809203855392,"x":0.17901233325648672,"c":1,"t":"Then there's a new maze, a circular series of paths, separated by low hedges.","h":0.013250883392226132,"w":0.58024693806966143},{"x":0.17901234149165873,"w":0.58230453491210943,"t":"That's near the west gate - you go north from there towards the river and then","h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.43604651150771589,"c":1},{"h":0.011778563015312216,"t":"turn left to reach it.","x":0.1769547298156679,"y":0.45200235589997595,"w":0.1419753138224284,"c":1},{"w":0.5617284138997396,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.1790123362923407,"y":0.47232037672492599,"t":"There have been tennis courts in the park for many years, and they've been"},{"c":1,"y":0.48691860451755675,"h":0.014553715960858749,"x":0.17695472205454546,"w":0.56790125528971358,"t":"doubled, from four to eight. They're still in the south-west corner of the park,"},{"c":1,"t":"where there's a right-angle bend in the path.","x":0.17901235506692251,"w":0.33127571105957043,"y":0.50145348863544803,"h":0.011627906062437354},{"t":"Something else I'd like to mention is the new fitness area. This is right next to the","y":0.52325581384695619,"w":0.60082305908203126,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.17901233866705601,"c":1},{"y":0.53769140184324959,"x":0.17901234258284718,"t":"lily pond on the same side as the west gate.","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"w":0.32716049194335939},{"c":1,"t":"Now, as you're all gardeners, I'm sure you'll like to hear about the plants that","x":0.17695473837277756,"w":0.57201644897460935,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.55948174314632393},{"t":"have been chosen for the park.","y":0.57703488361105471,"x":0.17901233976298186,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.23251029968261722,"c":1},{"x":0.088442434847597493,"h":0.014768622929693276,"c":1,"y":0.62924359536779328,"t":"PART 3","w":0.096777680714925138},{"c":1,"x":0.088477367197872331,"y":0.65843023244358523,"w":0.055555553436279298,"t":"CATHY:","h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.008822347867896041,"w":0.059700317382812507,"y":0.67291440744599651,"t":"GRAHAM:","c":1,"x":0.088462598410980725},{"x":0.08635305839786464,"y":0.6873510531289615,"c":1,"w":0.051573718388875311,"h":0.011925800669460029,"t":"CATHY:"},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"x":0.16872428475363288,"t":"OK, Graham, so let's check we both know what we're supposed to be doing.","w":0.57818929036458333,"c":1,"y":0.65694935204593197},{"x":0.088451701092604834,"w":0.059722112019856777,"h":0.0088978937012006432,"c":1,"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.71648128569167202},{"x":0.088477366353169065,"y":0.74563953476916656,"w":0.047325102488199863,"t":"CATHY:","c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.78910858672006523,"h":0.0089921288552076151,"c":1,"x":0.088438244747767,"w":0.059749024709065748},{"c":1,"x":0.086419753786567105,"t":"CATHY:","h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.86046511605829834,"w":0.049382715225219725},{"t":"GRAHAM:","y":0.87645348827868774,"x":0.08847736764360592,"w":0.059670778910319022,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1},{"y":0.90552325571662573,"c":1,"t":"CATHY:","h":0.0087209303892965551,"x":0.088477366348492653,"w":0.047325102488199877},{"y":0.68604651149465856,"c":1,"t":"So, for the university's open day, we have to plan a display on British life and","x":0.17695473021001221,"w":0.56995885213216146,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"x":0.17879128858987897,"t":"literature in the mid-19th century.","h":0.015253441634251241,"w":0.24740175882975263,"c":1,"y":0.6985921445791422},{"w":0.57818929036458333,"t":"That's right. But we'll have some people to help us find the materials and set it","x":0.1810699637683256,"y":0.71511627894988616,"h":0.013093379417212669,"c":1},{"x":0.1790123460900106,"y":0.72965116266843832,"w":0.41358024597167964,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"up, remember - for the moment, we just need to plan it.","c":1},{"t":"Good. So have you gathered who's expected to come and see the display? Is","y":0.74411071847690391,"w":0.57407409667968745,"c":1,"x":0.18106994744055271,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"t":"it for the people studying English, or students from other departments? I'm not","x":0.17901233333179051,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.58024693806966154,"y":0.75872093011267672,"c":1},{"w":0.10288065592447915,"y":0.77325581383893405,"x":0.17901234694423257,"c":1,"t":"clear about it.","h":0.010313090783828027},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"x":0.17901234431911689,"t":"Nor me. That was how it used to be, but it didn't attract many people, so this","w":0.56378601074218748,"y":0.78769140141145988},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"y":0.80232558128858555,"x":0.17901234149898329,"c":1,"w":0.58230453491210943,"t":"year it's going to be part of an open day, to raise the university's profile. It'll be."},{"w":0.57201644897460935,"x":0.17901235154534068,"y":0.81684334492686561,"h":0.011778563015312105,"t":"publicised in the city, to encourage people to come and find out something of","c":1},{"y":0.82979976434133174,"w":0.59259256998697918,"c":1,"h":0.013250883392226243,"t":"what goes on here. And it's included in the information that's sent to people who","x":0.17901236143998081},{"y":0.84593023244732779,"w":0.36213991800944006,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"are considering applying to study here next year.","x":0.17901234540125605},{"y":0.85898410588640872,"h":0.013398166539671852,"c":1,"x":0.18101145650232789,"t":"Presumably some current students and lecturers will come?","w":0.44251536051432294},{"h":0.013103651354534729,"y":0.87499999988005916,"w":0.58230453491210943,"x":0.17901234149118322,"c":1,"t":"I would imagine so, but we've been told to concentrate on the other categories"},{"y":0.88740730740746443,"t":"of people.","c":1,"h":0.014429570929321733,"w":0.076573270161946622,"x":0.17879155351939272},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.17901233980613085,"t":"Right. We don't have to cover the whole range of 19th-century literature, do we?","y":0.90253239097564364,"c":1,"w":0.59465021769205728},{"c":1,"t":"Test 2","w":0.057863089243570975,"x":0.81057462811439374,"y":0.10291765179795243,"h":0.013641440545431482},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.037037035624186254,"t":"Q14","y":0.18895348812372537,"x":0.8106995893072485},{"t":"Q15","y":0.2979651161206367,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"x":0.81275720204021318},{"w":0.034979422887166267,"c":1,"t":"Q16","y":0.33430232539843474,"x":0.8127572019823428,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"x":0.81275720203378299,"t":"Q17","y":0.38517441846595923,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.43604651148707751,"x":0.81275720224963532,"t":"Q18","w":0.037037035624186143,"c":1},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.48691860451033331,"w":0.034979422887166378,"t":"Q19","x":0.81275720204021318,"c":1},{"t":"Q20","x":0.81275720224963532,"w":0.037037035624186143,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.52325581381265895},{"t":"Q21\/Q22","x":0.79629629585239736,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.80087209287597161,"w":0.072016461690266986,"c":1},{"x":0.79627630360831025,"t":"Q21\/Q22","y":0.82988672582086564,"h":0.013191664598013353,"c":1,"w":0.072056446075439484},{"t":"103","y":0.92092012431688719,"x":0.83402866506412565,"w":0.037703987757364832,"h":0.015717890574317051,"c":1}],"w":2400}